    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"letting go\" doesn't feel like relief. it feels like being dead while you're still breathing. i look at people who actually matter, people who leave a mark, and then i look at my life and it's just... empty. it's just noise. if you aren't going anywhere, and you aren't anything special, what's the point of dragging all this around for another fifty years? it feels like a waste of time to even keep going like this.",
